0581</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Venturi</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Madeddu</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Rezza</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ciccozzi</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Pettinato</surname> <given-names>ML</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Cilliano</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Detection of Toscana virus central nervous system infections in Sardinia Island, Italy.</article-title><source>J Clin Virol</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>40</volume>:<fpage>90</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jcv.2007.06.005</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17662649</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>